<title>JAPAN: JR Tokai to replace Nomura as listing manager.</title>
<headline>JR Tokai to replace Nomura as listing manager.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Japan Railway Co (JR Tokai) said on Wednesday that it would change the lead manager for the company's scheduled stock listing in October from Nomura Securities Co to Nikko Securities Co.</p>
</text>
